        "Return-Rate Ratio": 3.85
    },
    2021: {
        "Stock Returns": 3.63,
        "Interest Rates": 5.19,
        "Return-Rate Ratio": 3.63
    }
}
```

This nested dictionary structure allows you to easily access and manipulate the data as needed.

